{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bf42adb-db0e-11ef-99c3-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bf42ab2-db0e-11ef-80a0-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"卜","people_name_jianti_auto":"卜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab4-db0e-11ef-b6b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田","people_name_jianti_auto":"田","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab5-db0e-11ef-8cfd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab6-db0e-11ef-90c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳敬仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈敬仲","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab7-db0e-11ef-9d38-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab8-db0e-11ef-960f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab9-db0e-11ef-ae45-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徐廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐广","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8bf42aba-db0e-11ef-a1a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8bf42abb-db0e-11ef-ba3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8bf42abc-db0e-11ef-89d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田","people_name_jianti_auto":"田","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8bf42abd-db0e-11ef-a4a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8bf42abe-db0e-11ef-9032-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"卜，以官爲氏。田本出於陳，陳敬仲以陳爲田氏。徐廣曰：始食采地，由是改姓田氏。索隱曰：陳、田二聲相近，遂爲田氏。夏，戶雅翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"卜，以官为氏。田本出于陈，陈敬仲以陈为田氏。徐广曰：始食采地，由是改姓田氏。索隐曰：陈、田二声相近，遂为田氏。夏，户雅翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab3-db0e-11ef-b965-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李耳","people_name_jianti_auto":"李耳","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac1-db0e-11ef-a51f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"伯陽","people_name_jianti_auto":"伯阳","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac2-db0e-11ef-9045-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"耼","people_name_jianti_auto":"耼","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac3-db0e-11ef-9d33-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"李宗","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac4-db0e-11ef-97e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"段","people_name_jianti_auto":"段","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac5-db0e-11ef-8823-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"段","people_name_jianti_auto":"段","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac6-db0e-11ef-aae7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"赧王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赧王","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac7-db0e-11ef-a3c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"段干子","people_name_jianti_auto":"段干子","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac8-db0e-11ef-8ef7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"段干","people_name_jianti_auto":"段干","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac9-db0e-11ef-bd10-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武王","people_name_jianti_auto":"武王","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"8bf42aca-db0e-11ef-ad29-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"商容","people_name_jianti_auto":"商容","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8bf42acb-db0e-11ef-a216-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"8bf42acc-db0e-11ef-8828-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔穎達","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔颖达","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"8bf42acd-db0e-11ef-bafe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ace-db0e-11ef-882e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8bf42acf-db0e-11ef-993c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ad0-db0e-11ef-9ac4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"過，工禾翻。唐人志氏族曰：李耳，字伯陽，一字耼；其後有李宗，魏封於段，爲干木大夫，是以段爲氏也。余按：通鑑赧王四十二年，魏有段干子，則段干，複姓也。書：武王式商容閭。註云：式其閭巷，以禮賢。記·曲禮：國君撫式，士下之。註云：升車必正立，據式小俛，崇敬也。師古曰：式，車前橫木。古者立乘；凡言式車者，謂俛首撫式，以禮敬人。孔穎達曰：式，謂俯下頭也。古者車箱長四尺四寸而三分，前一後二，橫一木，下去車牀三尺三寸，謂之爲式；又於式上二尺二寸橫一木，謂之較，較去車牀凡五尺五寸。於時立乘，若平常則憑較，故詩云「倚重較兮」是也。若應爲敬，則落隱下式，而頭得俯俛，故記云「式視馬尾」是也。較，訖岳翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"过，工禾翻。唐人志氏族曰：李耳，字伯阳，一字耼；其后有李宗，魏封于段，为干木大夫，是以段为氏也。余按：通鉴赧王四十二年，魏有段干子，则段干，复姓也。书：武王式商容闾。注云：式其闾巷，以礼贤。记·曲礼：国君抚式，士下之。注云：升车必正立，据式小俛，崇敬也。师古曰：式，车前横木。古者立乘；凡言式车者，谓俛首抚式，以礼敬人。孔颖达曰：式，谓俯下头也。古者车箱长四尺四寸而三分，前一后二，横一木，下去车床三尺三寸，谓之为式；又于式上二尺二寸横一木，谓之较，较去车床凡五尺五寸。于时立乘，若平常则凭较，故诗云「倚重较兮」是也。若应为敬，则落隐下式，而头得俯俛，故记云「式视马尾」是也。较，讫岳翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ac0-db0e-11ef-bbed-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"段干木，战国时期初期人物。","link_td_id":"Q10004288","link_td_number_id":1608700,"people_name":"段干木","people_name_jianti_auto":"段干木","people_xingming":"段干木","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8bf42adb-db0e-11ef-99c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/卜子夏","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。按《史记》所书，子夏少孔子四十四岁，孔子卒时，子夏年二...","context_before":"","source_end_index":9,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4b1e305c-9d40-4764-94a5-a5aa733b8bdd","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"魏文侯以卜子夏为师"}],"path":"续笔/卷二/卜子夏","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"魏文侯以卜子夏、田子方爲師。每過段干木之廬必式。四方賢士多歸之。","content_fanyi":"魏文侯魏斯尊崇卜子夏、田子方为老师。他每次经过段干木的庐舍，一定手扶车轼俯首致敬。四方贤士因此多来归附他。","content_jianti_auto":"魏文侯以卜子夏、田子方为师。每过段干木之庐必式。四方贤士多归之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 20 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab2-db0e-11ef-80a0-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000340"},"tongjian_id":"8bf42ab2-db0e-11ef-80a0-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"李氏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8bf6767b-db0e-11ef-90eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顓頊","people_name_jianti_auto":"颛顼","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8bf6767c-db0e-11ef-9555-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"皋陶","people_name_jianti_auto":"皋陶","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8bf6767d-db0e-11ef-af6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堯","people_name_jianti_auto":"尧","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8bf6767e-db0e-11ef-af11-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"理氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"理氏","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8bf6767f-db0e-11ef-9088-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"商紂","people_name_jianti_auto":"商纣","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8bf67680-db0e-11ef-a6ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"利貞","people_name_jianti_auto":"利贞","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8bf67681-db0e-11ef-afdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"李氏","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8bf67682-db0e-11ef-8898-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"李氏出自顓頊曾孫皋陶，爲堯大理，以官命族爲理氏。商紂時，裔孫利貞逃難，食木子得全，改爲李氏。置，言置相也。相，息亮翻。難，乃旦翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"李氏出自颛顼曾孙皋陶，为尧大理，以官命族为理氏。商纣时，裔孙利贞逃难，食木子得全，改为李氏。置，言置相也。相，息亮翻。难，乃旦翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index