41-db0e-11ef-89ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隰","place_name_jianti_auto":"隰","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"971ff742-db0e-11ef-ba02-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉國","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋国","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"971ff743-db0e-11ef-86fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":224,"tongjian_id":"971ff744-db0e-11ef-8430-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":227,"tongjian_id":"971ff745-db0e-11ef-bfbb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":245,"tongjian_id":"971ff746-db0e-11ef-b7b9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"呂氏春秋曰：顏涿聚，梁父大盜也，學於孔子。左傳，晉伐齊，戰于黎丘，齊師敗績，知伯親禽顏庚。杜預註曰：黎丘，隰也。顏庚，齊大夫顏涿聚也。又曰：晉荀瑤伐鄭，鄭請救於齊。齊師將興，陳成子設乘車、兩馬，繫五邑焉，召顏涿聚之子晉曰：「隰之役，而父死焉。今君命汝是邑，服車而朝，毋廢前勞。」呂氏春秋曰：段干木晉國之駔。說文曰：駔，會也，謂合兩家之買賣，如今之度市也。新序曰：魏文侯過段干木之閭而軾之，國人誦之曰：「吾君好正，段干木之敬；吾君好忠，段干木之隆。」秦欲攻魏，司馬唐諫曰：「段干木，賢者也，而魏禮之，天下莫不聞，毋乃不可加兵乎！」駔，子朗翻。卒，子恤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吕氏春秋曰：颜涿聚，梁父大盗也，学于孔子。左传，晋伐齐，战于黎丘，齐师败绩，知伯亲禽颜庚。杜预注曰：黎丘，隰也。颜庚，齐大夫颜涿聚也。又曰：晋荀瑶伐郑，郑请救于齐。齐师将兴，陈成子设乘车、两马，系五邑焉，召颜涿聚之子晋曰：「隰之役，而父死焉。今君命汝是邑，服车而朝，毋废前劳。」吕氏春秋曰：段干木晋国之驵。说文曰：驵，会也，谓合两家之买卖，如今之度市也。新序曰：魏文侯过段干木之闾而轼之，国人诵之曰：「吾君好正，段干木之敬；吾君好忠，段干木之隆。」秦欲攻魏，司马唐谏曰：「段干木，贤者也，而魏礼之，天下莫不闻，毋乃不可加兵乎！」驵，子朗翻。卒，子恤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"971ff722-db0e-11ef-b019-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘧伯玉","people_name_jianti_auto":"蘧伯玉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"971ff74e-db0e-11ef-8057-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"971ff74f-db0e-11ef-8d8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顏回","people_name_jianti_auto":"颜回","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"971ff750-db0e-11ef-8745-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"論語曰：蘧伯玉使人於孔子，子問之曰：「夫子何爲？」對曰：「夫子欲寡其過而未能也。」又語曰：「顏回好學，不貳過。」蘧，求於翻。瑗，于眷翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"论语曰：蘧伯玉使人于孔子，子问之曰：「夫子何为？」对曰：「夫子欲寡其过而未能也。」又语曰：「颜回好学，不贰过。」蘧，求于翻。瑗，于眷翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"971ff74d-db0e-11ef-8d58-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"971ff755-db0e-11ef-b96f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"971ff756-db0e-11ef-913d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭玄","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑玄","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"971ff757-db0e-11ef-be28-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：論語孔子之言也。鄭玄註云：不仁之人，當以風化之，若疾之甚，是益使爲亂也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：论语孔子之言也。郑玄注云：不仁之人，当以风化之，若疾之甚，是益使为乱也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"971ff754-db0e-11ef-902c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"段干木，战国时期初期人物。","link_td_id":"Q10004288","link_td_number_id":1608700,"people_name":"段干木","people_name_jianti_auto":"段干木","people_xingming":"段干木","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"971ff75d-db0e-11ef-9bbc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"971dc0fd-db0e-11ef-9fcd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zǎng","source_anchor_text":"晉國之大駔卒為齊之","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":51,"text":"駔","tongjian_id":"4896cec3-bf8f-5dac-a1b7-a91590d51aef"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"971dc0fd-db0e-11ef-9fcd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"qú","source_anchor_text":"魏之名賢蘧瑗顏回尚","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":65,"text":"蘧","tongjian_id":"2c2b04a0-17c7-5a87-940b-19b7a4705ec0"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"971dc0fd-db0e-11ef-9fcd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yuàn","source_anchor_text":"之名賢蘧瑗顏回尚不","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":66,"text":"瑗","tongjian_id":"12b5bcb9-4762-5f15-8480-876b91720c1a"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"陳留左原，爲郡學生，犯法見斥，泰遇諸路，爲設酒肴以慰之。謂曰：「昔顏涿聚，梁甫之巨盜，段干木，晉國之大駔，卒爲齊之忠臣，魏之名賢；蘧瑗、顏回尚不能無過，況其餘乎！愼勿恚恨，責躬而已！」原納其言而去。或有譏泰不絕惡人者，泰曰：「人而不仁，疾之已甚，亂也。」原後忽更懷忿結客，欲報諸生。其日，泰在學，原愧負前言，因遂罷去。後事露，衆人咸謝服焉。","content_fanyi":"陈留人左原是郡学的学生，因犯法被斥退，郭泰在路上遇见他，便摆下酒菜安慰他，说：“从前颜涿聚是梁甫山的大盗，段干木是晋国的大市侩，最终分别成为齐国的忠臣和魏国的名贤；蘧瑗、颜回尚且不能没有过失，何况其他人呢！千万不要心怀怨恨，只应反躬自责罢了！”左原接受了他的劝告后离去。有人讥讽郭泰不肯与恶人断绝往来，郭泰说：“对于不仁的人，如果憎恶得太过分，就会生出乱子。”左原后来忽然又心怀愤恨，结交同伙，想报复郡学的学生们。那天，郭泰正在郡学中，左原惭愧辜负了郭泰先前的劝告，于是作罢离去。后来事情泄露出来，众人都感谢并敬服郭泰。","content_jianti_auto":"陈留左原，为郡学生，犯法见斥，泰遇诸路，为设酒肴以慰之。谓曰：「昔颜涿聚，梁甫之巨盗，段干木，晋国之大驵，卒为齐之忠臣，魏之名贤；蘧瑗、颜回尚不能无过，况其余乎！愼勿恚恨，责躬而已！」原纳其言而去。或有讥泰不绝恶人者，泰曰：「人而不仁，疾之已甚，乱也。」原后忽更怀忿结客，欲报诸生。其日，泰在学，原愧负前言，因遂罢去。后事露，众人咸谢服焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4690,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十五 (漢紀四十七) / 孝桓皇帝中 / 延熹七年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"971dc0fd-db0e-11ef-9fcd-a0d3651f611f","year_int":164},"tongjian_id":"971dc0fd-db0e-11ef-9fcd-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"profile":{"alias_list":["段干子"],"biography":"段干木，战国时期初期人物。","link_td_id":"Q10004288","name":"段干木","number_id":1608700},"relationships":[{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"向其请教，来源文本：魏文侯經常向孔子的弟子子夏以及再傳弟子田子方、段干木等請教","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10008342","source_person_name":"魏文侯","source_person_number_id":211476,"statement_id":"S-Q10008342-P100061-Q10004288","target_person_id":"Q10004288","target_person_name":"段干木","target_person_number_id":1608700},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"被同一人推荐给魏文侯，来源文本：曾经和子夏、段干木都被魏成推荐给魏文侯","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10013710","source_person_name":"田子方","source_person_number_id":1608668,"statement_id":"S-Q10013710-P100061-Q10004288","target_person_id":"Q10004288","target_person_name":"段干木","target_person_number_id":1608700}]},"message":"success","success":true}